      "versionNonce": 88922,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795644185535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Diagram scope\n\nImplemented research harness:\ndataset preparation, indexing,\nreward datasets, LoRA training,\nand benchmark evaluation.\n\nBackend application owns\nuse cases and protocol ports.\nInfrastructure implements ports.\nDomain owns research entities.\n\nReact uses feature hooks and\na shared HTTP client; Tauri\nprovides the desktop shell.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Diagram scope\n\nImplemented research harness:\ndataset preparation, indexing,\nreward datasets, LoRA training,\nand benchmark evaluation.\n\nBackend application owns\nuse cases and protocol ports.\nInfrastructure implements ports.\nDomain owns research entities.\n\nReact uses feature hooks and\na shared HTTP client; Tauri\nprovides the desktop shell.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
