      "text": "application/use_cases/\ndataset/: load \u00b7 split \u00b7 prepare \u00b7 index \u00b7 list questions     generation/: generate \u00b7 rewrite \u00b7 answer \u00b7 measure tokens\nretrieval/: retrieve / search \u00b7 build context \u00b7 score evidence     rewards/: R0 evidence \u00b7 R1 teacher agreement \u00b7 R2 continuation \u00b7 R3 synthetic QA\ntraining/: build reward datasets \u00b7 select rewrite \u00b7 start / train adapter \u00b7 manage artifacts\nevaluation/: benchmark config \u00b7 start / run evaluation \u00b7 evaluate rewriters \u00b7 summarize     system/: readiness \u00b7 memory",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "application/use_cases/\ndataset/: load \u00b7 split \u00b7 prepare \u00b7 index \u00b7 list questions     generation/: generate \u00b7 rewrite \u00b7 answer \u00b7 measure tokens\nretrieval/: retrieve / search \u00b7 build context \u00b7 score evidence     rewards/: R0 evidence \u00b7 R1 teacher agreement \u00b7 R2 continuation \u00b7 R3 synthetic QA\ntraining/: build reward datasets \u00b7 select rewrite \u00b7 start / train adapter \u00b7 manage artifacts\nevaluation/: benchmark config \u00b7 start / run evaluation \u00b7 evaluate rewriters \u00b7 summarize     system/: readiness \u00b7 memory",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary_note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 890,
      "width": 245,
      "height": 262.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c7cfa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 71061,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 88980,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795644185535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Research boundaries\n\nPrepare: filter QA, preserve\nfull conversation histories.\n\nIndex: conversation turns only;\nQA annotations are excluded.\n\nR1\u2013R3 never read gold evidence.\nR0 and evaluation may read it.\n\nEvaluation reloads the pinned\ncorpus / split and uses dedicated\npartition-specific collections.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Research boundaries\n\nPrepare: filter QA, preserve\nfull conversation histories.\n\nIndex: conversation turns only;\nQA annotations are excluded.\n\nR1\u2013R3 never read gold evidence.\nR0 and evaluation may read it.\n\nEvaluation reloads the pinned\ncorpus / split and uses dedicated\npartition-specific collections.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
